Place data
----------
src-tauri/data/places.tsv.gz is derived from the GeoNames geographical database
(cities1000, admin1CodesASCII, countryInfo), https://www.geonames.org,
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). It was reduced to the columns
the app needs (name, region, country, position, population) by
src-tauri/examples/build_places.rs. The data is embedded in the built app.

Map data (not distributed with the app)
---------------------------------------
Base maps are loaded at runtime from OpenFreeMap (https://openfreemap.org),
using OpenMapTiles and OpenStreetMap data (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL).
Place search uses the Photon geocoder (https://photon.komoot.io), also based on
OpenStreetMap data. Attribution is shown on the map.
